# vehje-ir. backlog

Designed but deferred. Names here stay unbackticked so the doc lints ignore
them; each is promoted into DESIGN when it ships.

## The mutable-consumer lease qualifier lattice

The shipping lease is the immutable strictly-nested depth-lease floor: a
reach-mask collapsed to lexical nesting. The full reachability qualifier
lattice (mutable, aliased, and escaping cases) grows the reach-mask additively,
gated on the avoidance-rate experiment. The reach-mask type ships now; the
lattice growth is later.

## Array and blob literals

The literal payload ships Unit, Bool, Int, and interned string. Array and blob
literals need a byte arena the literal handle indexes into. Defer until a
consumer surfaces the need.

## Packed node encoding

The node is an enum slot today. A bit-packed encoding (a small tag plus inline
operands) is a wire-format concern owned by vehje-runtime-abi, not the in-memory
IR; the in-memory representation stays an enum. Revisit only if profiling shows
the in-memory slot wastes space that matters.

## Doc family constructor list

The document consumer's introduction fragment (a Doc family) is an ecosystem
crate, not a framework crate. It attaches through Raw like any family; nothing
is owed here beyond the Raw seam that already ships.

## Deepdive owed

A deepdive on the grade side-table layout and the one-bitmask-machinery mirror
across the four axes, once the check pass fills the grade table for real.
